m().split(' ')[0]} — you'll receive a mail for early access in a few days.</div>\n89\t        </div>\n90\t      </div>\n91\t    )\n92\t  }\n93\t\n94\t  const pill = (selected) => ({\n95\t    flex: 1, padding: '12px 6px', borderRadius: 13, cursor: 'pointer', textAlign: 'center', position: 'relative',\n96\t    border: selected ? `1.5px solid ${PALETTE.primary}` : `1.5px solid ${border}`,\n97\t    background: selected ? PALETTE.primarySoft : fieldBg,\n98\t    color: selected ? PALETTE.primaryDark : textPrimary,\n99\t    fontFamily: FONTS.sans, fontWeight: 700, fontSize: 16, transition: 'all .15s ease',\n100\t  })\n101\t  const input = { width: '100%', boxSizing: 'border-box', padding: '13px 14px', borderRadius: 13, border: `1.5px solid ${border}`, background: fieldBg, color: textPrimary, fontFamily: FONTS.sans, fontSize: 15, outline: 'none' }\n102\t\n103\t  return (\n104\t    <div style={shell}>\n105\t      <div style={card}>\n106\t        <div style={headerPill}>{glyph} ZenRayProgress</div>\n107\t\n108\t        {/* Accroche + grand prix (le montant choisi pilote le grand chiffre, effet Supaste) */}\n109\t        <div style={{ textAlign: 'center', marginBottom: 18 }}>\n110\t          <div style={{ fontFamily: FONTS.sans, fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 600, letterSpacing: 0.2, color: PALETTE.primaryDark, marginBottom: 10 }}>Choose a fair price</div>\n111\t          <div style={{ display: 'flex', alignItems: 'baseline', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 8 }}>\n112\t            <span style={{ ...priceFont, fontSize: 'clamp(46px,11vw,62px)', lineHeight: 1, color: textPrimary, letterSpacing: -1 }}>${effectiveAmount || MIN_CUSTOM}</span>\n113\t            <span style={{ fontFamily: FONTS.sans, fontSize: 14, color: textSecondary }}>once</span>\n114\t          </div>\n115\t        </div>\n116\t\n117\t        {/* Choix du montant */}\n118\t        <div style={{ display: 'flex', gap: 9, marginBottom: 12 }}>\n119\t          {PRESETS.map((v) => (\n120\t            <div key={v} role=\"button\" tabIndex={0} onClick={() => { setCustom(false); setAmount(v) }} onKeyDown={(e) => { if (e.key === 'Enter') { setCustom(false); setAmount(v) } }} style={pill(!custom && amount === v)}>\n121\t              <span style={priceFont}>${v}</span>\n122\t              {v === 30 && <span style={{ position: 'absolute', top: -9, right: -6, background: PALETTE.gradient, color: '#fff', fontFamily: FONTS.sans, fontSize: 9, fontWeight: 700, padding: '2px 7px', borderRadius: 99, letterSpacing: 0.3 }}>recommended</span>}\n123\t            </div>\n124\t          ))}\n125\t          <div role=\"button\" tabIndex={0} onClick={() => setCustom(true)} onKeyDown={(e) => { if (e.key === 'Enter') setCustom(true) }} style={pill(custom)}>Custom</div>\n126\t        </div>\n127\t\n128\t        {custom && (\n129\t          <div style={{ marginBottom: 12 }}>\n130\t            <div style={{ position: 'relative' }}>\n131\t              <span style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 14, top: '50%', transform: 'translateY(-50%)', fontFamily: FONTS.sans, fontSize: 15, color: textSecondary }}>$</span>\n132\t              <input type=\"number\" min={MIN_CUSTOM} step={1} value={customVal} onChange={(e) => setCustomVal(e.target.value)} placeholder={`${MIN_CUSTOM} or more`} style={{ ...input, paddingLeft: 26 }} autoFocus />\n133\t            </div>\n134\t            <div style={{ fontFamily: FONTS.sans, fontSize: 11, color: textSecondary, marginTop: 5 }}>Minimum ${MIN_CUSTOM} — this is for people who value their time.</div>\n135\t          </div>\n136\t        )}\n137\t\n138\t        {/* Honeypot anti-spam : invisible aux humains ET aux lecteurs d'écran (aria-hidden + hors écran), rempli par les robots -> rejeté côté serveur. */}\n139\t        <input type=\"text\" name=\"company\" tabIndex={-1} autoComplete=\"off\" aria-hidden=\"true\" value={company} onChange={(e) => setCompany(e.target.value)} style={{ position: 'absolute', left: '-9999px', width: 1, height: 1, opacity: 0, pointerEvents: 'none' }} />\n140